"Export saves sessions with their accounts, quick commands, triggers, runbooks, host keys, the theme, the layout, settings, and the password vault in one file, with a .sha256 file next to it. The vault stays sealed under its master password, which is not saved in the file. Passwords remembered on this Mac are not included. Import replaces all of these and restarts Gloamux. The current ones are kept in the Backups folder of Gloamux's data folder first." = "匯出會把連線與帳號、快速指令、觸發條件、操作手冊、主機金鑰、主題、版面配置、設定和密碼庫存成一個檔案，旁邊附一個 .sha256 檔。密碼庫仍以主密碼加密，主密碼本身不會存進檔案。本機記住的密碼不會匯出。匯入會取代以上全部並重新啟動 Gloamux，目前的內容會先保留在 Gloamux 資料夾的 Backups 資料夾。";
"The password vault in the backup replaces the one on this Mac. Unlock it with the master password it was made with." = "備份中的密碼庫會取代這台 Mac 上的密碼庫。請用建立它時的主密碼解鎖。";
"The password vault in this Gloamux backup is damaged." = "這個 Gloamux 備份中的密碼庫已損壞。";

