"What the + buttons open. Default is a terminal on this Mac. A saved session connects at once; if it is deleted, the default opens. New connection (⇧⌘N) still opens the form." = "+ 按鈕開啟的內容。預設是這台 Mac 的終端。已儲存的連線會立刻連線；若已刪除，就開預設。新連線（⇧⌘N）仍開表單。";
"Resolution" = "解析度";
"Fit to window" = "跟隨視窗";
"Fit to window follows the window as you resize it. A fixed size stays the same and is scaled to fit the window." = "跟隨視窗時，遠端桌面會隨你調整視窗大小而改變。固定尺寸則維持不變，並縮放到符合視窗。";
"Display" = "顯示";
"Optimize for Retina displays" = "針對 Retina 顯示器最佳化";
"Asks the desktop for twice the pixels at 200% scaling, so text is sharp on a Retina display. Uses more bandwidth. Works with Fit to window." = "向遠端桌面要求兩倍像素並以 200% 縮放，在 Retina 螢幕上文字會很清晰。會使用較多頻寬，只在「跟隨視窗」時有效。";
