"Best quality shows the wallpaper, smooth fonts, and visual effects. Balanced hides the wallpaper. Fastest also turns off themes, animations, and font smoothing for a slow network." = "最佳畫質會顯示桌布、平滑字型和視覺效果。平衡會隱藏桌布。最快還會關閉主題、動畫和字型平滑，適合慢速網路。";
"Clipboard" = "剪貼簿";
"Check for Updates" = "檢查更新";
"Check for updates automatically" = "自動檢查更新";
"Once a day, Gloamux asks GitHub whether a newer version is out, sending only the app's name and version. Check at any time from Gloamux › Check for Updates." = "Gloamux 每天會向 GitHub 查詢一次是否有新版本，只會送出 App 的名稱和版本。隨時可以從 Gloamux › 檢查更新 立即檢查。";
"SSH jump hosts" = "SSH 跳板";
"Gloamux connects to these in order, from the top, and reaches this server from the last one. A password typed here is used for this connection only; after it works, it is remembered like any other." = "Gloamux 會由上而下依序連線這些跳板，再從最後一台連到這台伺服器。在這裡輸入的密碼只用於這次連線；登入成功後，會和其他密碼一樣記住。";
"Remove this jump host" = "移除這個跳板";
"Jump host %d" = "跳板 %d";
"Add jump host" = "新增跳板";
"Save another SSH session first to use it as a jump host." = "請先儲存另一個 SSH 連線，才能當作跳板。";
"Connect through another saved SSH session" = "經由另一個已儲存的 SSH 連線連線";
"Gloamux connects to the jump hosts in order, from the first, and reaches this server from the last one. Only the first one uses its own jump host settings." = "Gloamux 會從第一台開始依序連線跳板，再從最後一台連到這台伺服器。只有第一台會使用它自己的跳板設定。";
"Some jump hosts could not be found in this file. Set the jump hosts in Gloamux." = "這個檔案中找不到部分跳板。請在 Gloamux 中設定跳板。";
"Connection route" = "連線路徑";
"Gloamux signs in to each jump host in turn and asks it to open the connection to the next host, so each host is reached only from the one above it. Check from each server asks every server where the connection came from (echo $SSH_CONNECTION); each one should name the host above it. A server set to run a fixed command for your key runs that command instead." = "Gloamux 會依序登入每一台跳板，並請它開啟到下一台主機的連線，所以每台主機只會從它上面那一台連進來。「從每台伺服器確認」會詢問每台伺服器連線是從哪裡來的（echo $SSH_CONNECTION），每一台都應該顯示它上面那一台。如果伺服器為你的金鑰設定了固定指令，會改為執行那個指令。";
"Check from each server" = "從每台伺服器確認";
"Came from %@" = "來自 %@";
"The host above" = "就是上一台";
"This server did not say where the connection came from." = "這台伺服器沒有回報連線來源。";

