"Modern" = "新式";
"Compatible" = "相容";
"Modern offers only elliptic-curve key exchanges. Compatible also offers diffie-hellman-group16-sha512 and diffie-hellman-group14-sha256 for older servers and network devices. Servers that offer only SHA-1 key exchanges or ssh-rsa host keys still cannot connect." = "新式只提供橢圓曲線金鑰交換。相容另外提供 diffie-hellman-group16-sha512 與 diffie-hellman-group14-sha256，供較舊的伺服器與網路設備使用。只提供 SHA-1 金鑰交換或 ssh-rsa 主機金鑰的伺服器仍無法連線。";
"Dropdown window" = "下拉視窗";
"This key shows a Gloamux window across the top of the screen from any app, and hides it again. Its tabs stay open while it is hidden. It works while Gloamux is running." = "在任何 App 中按此鍵，螢幕頂端會顯示一個 Gloamux 視窗，再按一次即隱藏。隱藏時標籤頁仍保持開啟。Gloamux 執行時可用。";
"Another app uses this key. Choose a different one." = "另一個 App 正在使用此鍵，請選擇其他鍵。";
"⌥Space" = "⌥空白鍵";
"Show inline images" = "顯示內嵌圖片";
"Pictures that programs such as imgcat, chafa, img2sixel, and kitten icat send with sixel graphics, the iTerm2 image protocol, or the kitty graphics protocol appear in the terminal. Applies to new terminals." = "imgcat、chafa、img2sixel、kitten icat 等程式以 sixel 圖形、iTerm2 圖片協定或 kitty 圖片協定傳送的圖片會顯示在終端中。適用於新的終端。";
