"Stop loading" = "停止載入";
"The page was not opened because its certificate is not trusted." = "憑證不受信任，所以沒有開啟網頁。";
"The user name or password was not accepted." = "使用者名稱或密碼不正確。";
"This page says" = "網頁訊息";
"This site's certificate changed" = "這個網站的憑證變了";
"This site's certificate is not trusted" = "這個網站的憑證不受信任";
"User name" = "使用者名稱";
"Zoom in" = "放大";
"Zoom out" = "縮小";
"The page stopped working. Reload to try again." = "網頁停止運作。請重新載入再試一次。";
"New page" = "新網頁";
"Close page" = "關閉網頁";
"Pages in this panel keep their sign-ins and cookies only until Gloamux quits, apart from Safari." = "這個面板裡的網頁只把登入狀態和 Cookie 保留到 Gloamux 結束，和 Safari 分開。";
"Devices often use a certificate they made themselves. Compare this fingerprint with the one the device shows before trusting it. Gloamux then trusts this certificate for this address until it quits." = "設備常使用自己產生的憑證。請先和設備上顯示的指紋比對再信任。Gloamux 會在這個位址信任這張憑證，直到結束。";
"This page uses http, so the password crosses the network as plain text. Open it with https to protect it." = "這個網頁使用 http，密碼會以明文經過網路。改用 https 開啟才能保護它。";
"Record a video of this window?" = "要錄下這個視窗的影片嗎？";
"The video shows everything this window shows while it records: terminal output, file lists and paths, and commands in the Session Log. Nothing is masked. It pauses while a sheet such as a password prompt is open and while the window is in the Dock. Videos are saved in Downloads, or the folder chosen in Settings › General, readable only by your account." = "錄影期間，影片會錄下這個視窗顯示的一切：終端輸出、檔案清單與路徑，以及 連線歷史 裡的指令。內容不會遮蔽。開著密碼等工作表、或視窗縮到 Dock 時會暫停。影片存在「下載項目」或在「設定 › 一般」選的資料夾，只有你的帳號能讀取。";
"Record" = "錄影";
"Allow screen recording" = "允許錄製螢幕";
"macOS asks before an app records a window. Turn on Gloamux in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording, then record again. macOS may ask you to reopen Gloamux." = "macOS 會在 App 錄製視窗前先徵求同意。請到「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 螢幕與系統錄音」打開 Gloamux，再錄一次。macOS 可能會要求重新打開 Gloamux。";
"Open System Settings" = "打開系統設定";
"Record window video" = "錄製視窗影片";
"Stop window video" = "停止錄製視窗影片";
"Video paused while a sheet is open or the window is in the Dock. Click to stop." = "工作表開著或視窗在 Dock 時，影片暫停。按一下停止。";
"Recording this window. Click to stop." = "正在錄製這個視窗。按一下停止。";
"This window is already being recorded." = "這個視窗已經在錄影。";
"Gloamux records at most 4 windows at a time. Stop one first." = "Gloamux 一次最多錄製 4 個視窗。請先停止其中一個。";
"Gloamux needs Screen Recording permission. Turn on Gloamux in System Settings › Privacy & Security › Screen & System Audio Recording, then try again." = "Gloamux 需要螢幕錄製權限。請到「系統設定 › 隱私權與安全性 › 螢幕與系統錄音」打開 Gloamux，再試一次。";
"The window could not be found for recording. Show it and try again." = "找不到要錄製的視窗。請讓它顯示出來再試一次。";
"The video recording stopped at 4 GB. Start another to keep recording." = "影片到 4 GB 已停止錄製。要繼續錄請再開始一段。";
"The video recording stopped because less than 1 GB of disk space was left." = "磁碟剩不到 1 GB，影片已停止錄製。";
"The video recording stopped because the window could no longer be captured." = "無法再擷取視窗，影片已停止錄製。";
"Couldn’t finish the video. The part recorded so far gets its name the next time Gloamux opens." = "無法完成影片。已錄下的部分會在下次開啟 Gloamux 時取好檔名。";
"Format" = "格式";
"Both use H.264 video, which plays almost anywhere. MP4 suits the web and sharing; MOV suits QuickTime Player and Final Cut Pro." = "兩種都用 H.264 影像，幾乎哪裡都能播放。MP4 適合網頁和分享；MOV 適合 QuickTime Player 和 Final Cut Pro。";
"Quality" = "畫質";
"Standard" = "標準";
"High" = "高";
"Best" = "最佳";
"Standard records the window at its size in points, for small files. High records every pixel of a Retina display. Best also doubles the bit rate, so text stays sharp while it scrolls, and makes the largest files." = "標準以視窗的點數大小錄製，檔案小。高錄下 Retina 顯示器的每個像素。最佳再把位元率加倍，捲動時文字也清楚，檔案最大。";
"Frame rate" = "每秒張數";
"%@ frames per second" = "每秒 %@ 張";
"30 is smooth for typing and scrolling. 60 keeps fast scrolling smooth and makes files about twice as large." = "30 張打字和捲動已經流暢。60 張讓快速捲動也順，檔案約大一倍。";
"Show the pointer" = "顯示滑鼠游標";
"Shows the mouse pointer when it is over the window." = "滑鼠游標在視窗上時，錄進影片。";
"Window video" = "視窗錄影";
"Record window video in the toolbar or the Terminal menu (⇧⌘R) records the whole workspace window, without sound. Changes apply to the next recording." = "工具列或「終端」選單的「錄製視窗影片」（⇧⌘R）會錄下整個工作區視窗，不含聲音。變更從下一段錄影開始套用。";
"Terminal text recordings start from the Terminal menu or the command palette. Only what the terminal shows is recorded, never your keystrokes, and access tokens, private keys, and password values are replaced with [REDACTED]. Files use the asciinema format.\n\nWindow videos record the whole workspace window as a video file, without sound. Nothing in them is masked." = "終端文字錄影從「終端」選單或指令面板開始。只錄下終端顯示的內容，絕不錄下你的按鍵；存取權杖、私鑰和密碼值會換成 [REDACTED]。檔案使用 asciinema 格式。\n\n視窗錄影把整個工作區視窗錄成影片檔，不含聲音，內容不會遮蔽。";
"Terminal text" = "終端文字錄影";
"The video could not be written, so the recording stopped. The part recorded so far was kept." = "影片無法寫入，錄影已停止。已錄下的部分有保留。";
"Save videos in" = "影片存放位置";
"Videos are saved in Downloads unless you choose another folder. The Recordings window lists every video Gloamux saved, in whichever folder it is." = "影片預設存在「下載項目」，也可以選別的資料夾。錄影視窗會列出 Gloamux 存過的每支影片，不論在哪個資料夾。";
"Gloamux can’t save videos in the chosen folder. Choose another folder in Settings › General." = "Gloamux 無法把影片存到選定的資料夾。請在「設定 › 一般」選別的資料夾。";
